# Módulo de Autenticação (Auth Service)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Criar um Usuário de Teste (Caso não exista)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Everton Auth Test",
  "email": "everton.auth@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "user"
}

###

### 2. Login com Credenciais Válidas (Sucesso - 200 OK)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "everton.admin@example.com",
  "password": "adminPassword123"
}

###

### Guardar o Token JWT da resposta acima
@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

### 3. Login com Senha Incorreta (Erro - 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "everton.auth@example.com",
  "password": "wrongPassword123"
}

###

### 4. Login com E-mail Inexistente (Erro - 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "somePassword123"
}

###

### 5. Logout com Token Válido (Sucesso - 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 6. Logout sem Token (Erro - 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
